# Design components & control recipes (always on)

**Golden sentences:** Props = knobs; **slots = content**. Icons are Heroicons only. Interactive fields ≥16px. Drawers close with X only. Create-new forms start collapsed. Tabs reserve their indicator. The bottom pager is meta-left + actions-right.

---

## Slots vs props (ideal-stack registry)

Ask: *Could an author swap this for another component or edit it as its own Inspect target?*

| Yes → **slot** | No → **prop** |
| --- | --- |
| Title, subtitle, eyebrow, byline, cover, CTA | `layout`, `variant`, `padding`, `width`, `align`, `gap` |
| Button / link / figure as children | Booleans, enums, numeric scales |

**At most ~2 content-shaped concerns as raw string props** before splitting into slots or child primitives. CTAs are **Button primitives in slots** (`ctaPrimary` / `ctaSecondary`) — not byline HTML soup.

```ts
// ✅ props = knobs · slots = content / primitives
meta: {
  props: { layout: { type: "enum", values: ["magazine", "side", "backdrop"], … } },
  slots: { title, subtitle, eyebrow, byline, ctaPrimary, ctaSecondary, cover },
}
// ❌ content as scalar props — invisible to Inspect tree as components
props: { title: string, ctaLabel: string, ctaHref: string, imageUrl: string }
```

### Tree / Inspect navigable

| Do | Don't |
| --- | --- |
| Compose Live pages: `section → container → primitives/composites` | One site mega-component hiding all copy in one render |
| Stamp `data-as-component` / `data-as-slot` on every registry piece | Raw `<a class="nl-cta">` with no Button primitive |
| Promote repeated patterns into `design/components/` | `if (projectId === …)` one-offs |
| Nested primitives stay selectable (Button inside CTA slot) | Merge slot attrs onto a child that already has `data-as-component` |

Styling: utilities on the semantic tag; theme colors (`bg-paper`, `text-ink`, `border-line`, `bg-accent`) — not raw hex / `bg-zinc-*` / `dark:` palette hacks. Headless primitives accept `className` from compose; don't bake brand into shared defaults.

