## Icons — Heroicons only

**Golden sentence:** Studio chrome and ideal-stack UI icons come from **`@glassbox-studio/ui-icons`** (Heroicons outline/solid, remix/ui SVG factories). Emoji, unicode dingbats, and one-off hand-drawn `<svg>`/`path` icons = fail ship bar.

| Import | Use |
| --- | --- |
| `@glassbox-studio/ui-icons/24/outline/<name>` | Tree-shaken chrome icons (prefer) |
| `@glassbox-studio/ui-icons/24/solid/<name>` | Filled / active state |
| `@glassbox-studio/ui-icons` → `viewportIcon`, `heroIcon` | Live viewport chips; dynamic kebab names |
| `@glassbox-studio/ui-icons/ssr` → `moonOutlineSvg`, `glassBoxMarkSvgHtml`, … | String HTML / Worker SSR |

Catalog is vendored — `pnpm --filter @glassbox-studio/ui-icons sync` if Heroicons need refresh. Do **not** scrape ad-hoc SVGs into `apps/studio` or ideal-stack.

Factories return SVG vnodes — **call** them, don't mount as Handle components:

```tsx
import { XMarkIcon } from "@glassbox-studio/ui-icons/24/outline/x-mark";
<button type="button" aria-label="Close">{XMarkIcon({ class: "size-4 shrink-0" })}</button>

// ❌ emoji / hand-rolled
<span>⚙</span> <span>×</span> <span>☰</span>
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M…" /></svg>
```

**Exceptions (not "icons"):** multiplication sign in dimensions (`800×600`); checkmark in a plain-text status string; project content / marketing illustration; **Glass Box product mark** (`GlassBoxMarkIcon` / `glassBoxMarkSvgHtml` only — never `<img>` or forked SVG in chrome).

