## Input font size ≥16px

**Golden sentence:** Every interactive text field (`input`, `textarea`, `select`) uses **`font-size ≥ 16px`** (`text-[16px]` or larger). Smaller type on labels/chips/buttons is fine — focused form controls are not (iOS Safari zooms the viewport under 16px).

| Do | Don't |
| --- | --- |
| `text-[16px]` (or larger) on `input` / `textarea` / `select` | `text-[12px]` / `text-sm` / `text-xs` on those controls |
| Reuse `INPUT_TEXT_BASE` / shared field constants in `studio-ui-*.ts` | One-off small font on a new search/composer/reply field |

Ideal-stack: same floor on project form controls — theme may scale larger, never smaller than 16px for typed fields.

