## Create-new — collapsed until click

**Golden sentence:** Create-new **forms** stay closed. Fields appear only after **Create new**. Never paint empty create fields as the default face.

| # | Law | Fail if |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 1 | **Closed default** | Name / harness / id fields visible on first paint |
| 2 | **Create new = toggle** | Same button submits while fields already showing |
| 3 | **Submit in the open panel** | No footer Create / Save once the form is open |
| 4 | **XState owns `open`** | Handle `let createOpen` / coordinating boolean |
| 5 | **Success closes** | Panel stays open after a successful create |

`Create new` is `type="button"` + `aria-expanded` + `aria-controls`. Submit is a **second** control in `SETTINGS_GROUP_FOOTER` (`SETTINGS_BTN_PRIMARY`). Faces: Settings → `SETTINGS_BTN` "Create new" + chevron → `SETTINGS_GROUP` fields; Directory → full-width `DATA_GRID_BTN` + Plus. Canonical: `apps/studio/client/create-new/create-new-disclosure-view.tsx`.

**Instant create (no fields):** button may fire immediately (New note, New chat) — **no** fake dropdown. This rule is for forms that need input.

