## Table / directory footer pager

**Golden sentence:** A bottom pager row is **two peers** — status meta on the left, a **single actions cluster** (Prev/Next) on the right — with **horizontal inset that clears the rounded shell**.

```
<footer / div.DIRECTORY_PAGER>          ← flex justify-between items-center px-3.5 py-2
  <span.DIRECTORY_PAGER_META>           ← Page N of M
  <div.DIRECTORY_PAGER_ACTIONS>         ← inline-flex gap-1.5
    <button>Prev</button>
    <button>Next</button>
```

| Slot | Constant (Studio) | Role |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Row | `DIRECTORY_PAGER` | `justify-between` + `px-3.5` + balanced `py-2` + `items-center` |
| Meta | `DIRECTORY_PAGER_META` | Page label — left |
| Actions | `DIRECTORY_PAGER_ACTIONS` | Prev/Next **group** — right |

Inside a **rounded** table/card (`DATA_GRID` = `rounded-xl`, or any `rounded-*` + `overflow-hidden` shell): match body/toolbar horizontal gutter (`px-3.5` on Studio `DATA_GRID`); keep inset ≥ corner radius. `rounded-xl` ≈ 12px → `px-3.5` (14px) is the Studio floor.

| Do | Don't |
| --- | --- |
| Two flex children under `justify-between` | Meta + Prev + Next as three siblings |
| `flex-row` always — compact meta + icons under `@container` narrow | `flex-wrap` / `flex-col` (stacked regression) |
| `items-center` + `px-3.5 py-2` (balanced) | `pt-3` only / uneven vertical pad / no `px` |
| Group Prev/Next with `gap-1` / `gap-1.5` | Stretch Prev into the empty middle |

Chrome component: `studioPager` + `PAGER_*` in `@glassbox-studio/ui-components`. Shared directory slots: `pager` / `pagerMeta` / `pagerActions`.

