## Agent checklist (new/touched component)

- [ ] Content is slots (or child primitives); props are knobs only
- [ ] Classes are Tailwind + `@theme`; token score high (no raw hex/palette)
- [ ] New control uses `@glassbox-studio/ui-icons` factory; no emoji / inline SVG paths
- [ ] New field uses ≥16px; no `text-[1[0-5]px]` on `input` / `textarea` / `select`
- [ ] No grabber div / pseudo above a drawer header; header has title + X
- [ ] Create-new: first paint = title/hint + Create new only; `open` on a machine; success closes
- [ ] Underline tabs: idle + active share indicator thickness; section strips ≥12px air below
- [ ] Pager: exactly meta + actions wrapper; `px-*` clears rounded corners

